; gen_report.py is schema-agnostic (see osdp.trace) and meant to be
; reused by any project logging to an osdp.trace file, not just osdp
; itself, so it is installed alongside the library rather than kept as
; a purely internal dev script. Reachable from any consumer via
; `opam var osdp:share`/gen_report.py once installed.
(install
 (section share)
 (files gen_report.py)
 (package osdp))
